{"id":"lesson-1741","topicId":1741,"title":"第五单元","sourceTitle":"第五单元","blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1741","createdAt":"2024-08-22T10:09:42Z","updatedAt":"2024-08-22T10:09:42Z","postCount":1,"excerpt":"“一代人有一代人的长征,一代人有一代人的担当。” 今天,新时代的中国青年应当具有怎样的抱负,承担怎样的使命?这些问题值得我们认真思索。 本单元所选作品,或剖析社会矛盾,宣示历史使命;或概括伟人贡献,致以崇敬之情;或是上书言事,谏阻逐客;或为临终绝笔,直抒心志。这些作品表现出革命导师、有为之士顺应历史潮流,勇于担负时代使命的精神。 学习本单元,要通过专题研讨,加深对“抱负与使命”的认识。要注意这些作品切于实用、关注特定对象、富于针对性的特点;要结合具体作品,学习有理有据地发表意见,阐发主张;要把握书信注重交流、抒写自由的文体特质,体会作者的深挚情感。","textbook":{"bookId":"高中_语文_普通高中教科书_语文必修_下册","bookTitle":"普通高中教科书·语文必修 下册（人教版）","imageBase":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628","tocLabel":"第五单元","tocScore":1.11,"startPage":85,"pages":[85],"pageImages":[{"page":85,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p85.webp","label":"p85","matched":true}],"contextPages":[65,66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,83,84,85,86,87,88,89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103,104,105],"contextPageImages":[{"page":65,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p65.webp","label":"p65","matched":false},{"page":66,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p66.webp","label":"p66","matched":false},{"page":67,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p67.webp","label":"p67","matched":false},{"page":68,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p68.webp","label":"p68","matched":false},{"page":69,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p69.webp","label":"p69","matched":false},{"page":70,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p70.webp","label":"p70","matched":false},{"page":71,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p71.webp","label":"p71","matched":false},{"page":72,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p72.webp","label":"p72","matched":false},{"page":73,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p73.webp","label":"p73","matched":false},{"page":74,"src":"https://img.rdfzer.com/pages/9535dacc9628/p74.webp","lab